{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brainkilled \u2013 A Puzzle Game That Stays In Your Head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re smart? Good.<br>You\u2019ll need patience more than confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainkilled</strong> is a minimalist puzzle experience built for players who enjoy being stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t rush through levels.<br>You will stare.<br>You will try ideas.<br>You will close the game.<br>And hours later\u2026 the solution might hit you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes. One Brain.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Logic &amp; Observation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues can be hidden anywhere:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In what is not being said</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level requires you to <strong>discover the correct password</strong> to proceed.<br>Padlocks reveal the format \u2014 but never the answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd22 The Math Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not pattern matching.<br>Not guessing.<br>Real mathematical reasoning \u2014 from accessible concepts to genuinely demanding problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed For A Specific Type Of Player</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No step-by-step guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just structured problems and the satisfaction of finally breaking them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles won\u2019t let you go.<br>That\u2019s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience to survive\u2026 or will you get Brainkilled?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/f8f46d7c286b590d86b3e796153b041116985937.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/fdc51c0c15476af499b5acc325c3df43a518b353.jpg"},{"name":"Weird Maths!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/5b0eb87d3f148a14deee2fb7067c43ff6d97b4fa.jpg"},{"name":"Picklock expert!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/3ef589b17010c182c9abd2ae254b9c299335d975.jpg"},{"name":"3-Point!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/a04e619778b0364c2b896a70c09888ecd02265b6.jpg"},{"name":"Riddle Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/af175d41de342a7b4cf4cbee67433ee2b9305bf3.jpg"},{"name":"Maths Beginner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/553f1d03ec6e3ba1db12d4b767d8e8833e32ca01.jpg"},{"name":"Back to school!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/c121397150c196ce9913a6e97309e07b5a9dcac7.jpg"},{"name":"Slow and steady!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/aa88e21d086b81c02af8b3cb7ffb79a1b06a3aa0.jpg"},{"name":"Gauss?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505350/d693a798545c09b280d906a3c468963ac1fa3ab8.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505350?t=1772111180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505350/65518f701249f04b74ef15909136c