/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No step-by-step guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just structured problems and the satisfaction of finally breaking them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles won\u2019t let you go.<br>That\u2019s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience to survive\u2026 or will you get Brainkilled?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Brainkilled Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505350/e26507f0681447e43d5a035e747259948807b492/header.jpg?t=1772111180","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3505350/867706/585d5b236698aa11b59c2eb27abcd51c51632d65/1750856633/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747499911","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3505350/867706/585d5b236698aa11b59c2eb27abcd51c51632d65/1750856633/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747499911","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3505350/867706/585d5b236698aa11b59c2eb27abcd51c51632d65/1750856633/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747499911","id":257124579,"name":"Brainkilled","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124579/a0a28bb03c2d0118b6dfa6c8f0c3423b737092